      "value": "@{62cea1224517083b068f949b|full_name}: Why does the menu need your worldspace information, make it stationary and overlayed using camera.  These would not be issues if it only moved with tracking space and be completely disconnected from the world scene space.  This includes floating point problems.\n\nNote: the same problem occurs even when not in stations, moving fast outside of station also makes menus very difficult to use, and if far enough from origin they can be essentially impossible to use.",
